# DE ecosystem (one program)

DE is **one governed ecosystem**, not a pile of bolted integrations. Do not invent a second Hub, a second factual database, a second mail stack, or a second middleware layer.

## Repositories

| Role | Canonical repo | Default branch |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Control plane / operational source of truth | `digeratiexperts/Intelligence-Hub` (Intelligence Hub / TechSales) | `master` |
| Content / application projection | `digeratiexperts/digeratiexperts-site` (this repo) | `main` |
| Legacy / reference only | `digeratiexperts/TechSales` | do not start new work |

GitHub owns website / Store / portal / blog **application and versioned content code**. Hub owns operational/commercial truth. `Replit-Site` is a historical checkout name, not authority.

Hub docs (read there; **do not copy the 30-task ECO ledger into this repo**):

