## Pipeline truth

`git commit` ≠ merged ≠ deployed ≠ production verified.

A green CI check or a merge is not LIVE. Record deploy SHA and health before claiming production.

## Integration

Evolve existing Hub **`de-sync` + outbox/retry**. Do **not** create a second middleware stack.

Website durable paths already exist (`docs/DE-SYSTEM-INTEGRATION.md`). Extend those; do not fork a parallel integration layer.

