## Evidence plane

Hub **Knowledge System** is the evidence plane. Do not invent a second factual DB on the website.

Chain: **source → KB rule → approved claim → channel variants**.

Channel wording may differ; the approved fact/offer version must stay traceable. Do not hard-code parallel pricing, package rules, certifications, or capability claims when a canonical object exists.

## AI repair (Hub audited assistant only)

No admin AI backdoor. No website-side agent that bypasses Hub audit to “fix production.”

**Allow (still verify after):** inspect, retry idempotent sync, re-fetch stale records, reconcile allowlisted fields, rebuild caches, republish known-good mappings.

**Deny unless explicit DE approval + Hub audit:** deploy, rotate secrets, delete accounts, change pricing, merge accounts, send mail, post social, publish customer-facing statements.

## Email

**Zoho Mail is current DE email transport.** Do not build a new mail stack. Lifecycle email defaults **draft-only** until a template class is explicitly approved for send.

